      "cooked": "<p>Hey guys! I thought it might be fun to try and build what the Sentinels Timeline might look like. I know that they are releasing one. But why not try and start one as a group. Posting events we know happen and the heroes, villains and heroes that were in them. Anyone game? If you want to participate, just join in the conversation of when you think something happens.&nbsp;</p><p>FF=Freedom Five&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>FF 1: Baron Blade tries to dig to the earth's core. Freedom Four vs Baron Blade&nbsp;</p><p>Matriarch Event: FF vs Matriarch in Megalopolis.</p><p>Baron Blade tries to pull the moon into the earth ( Freedom Four vs Baron Blade in Atlantis)&nbsp;</p><p>Citizen Dawn attacks Megalopolis<span>.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>AkashButa: FF, Prime Wardens and Chrono Ranger vs AkashButa</p><p><span>Baron Blade plants bombs around Megalopolis. (Fanatic and other heroes and FF vs Baron Blade in Megalopolis)&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Plague Rat in Rook City: Dark Watch and Chrono Ranger vs Plague Rat in Rook City&nbsp;</span></p><p>Deadline&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>VENGEANCE</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Progeny&nbsp;</p><p>Skinwalker Gloomweaver&nbsp;</p><p>OBLIVION&nbsp;</p>",
